'''Ulaf''', known affectionately as '''Uli''',<ref name="Nobody's Listening">{{Andor|Nobody's Listening!}}</ref> was a [[human]] [[Gender|male]] [[prisoner]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] that served time on [[Narkina 5]]. He worked in [[Unit Five-Two-D]], at [[Table Five]].<ref name="Episode 8" /> Forty shifts from his release, Ulaf was pronounced brain-dead by [[Doctor]] [[Rhasiv]], a Med-Tech within the facility, after the elderly prisoner suffered a fatal stroke caused by his old age and his grueling working conditions. He was then [[Death|euthanized]], dying peacefully.<ref name="Nobody's Listening" /> Prior to his death, Ulaf was the longest-serving inmate in the prison.<ref name="DB">{{Databank|ulaf|Ulaf}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Ulaf appeared in the eighth episode of the [[Andor Season 1|first season]] of ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'', titled "[[Narkina 5 (episode)|Narkina 5]]," which released on [[October 26]], [[2022]]. Ulaf was portrayed by [[Christopher Fairbank]].

